{"type":"message","id":"cc3b6846","parentId":"5a73e769","timestamp":"2026-04-03T22:00:03.805Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:eb4407c8-7e9a-4d66-b956-2695d5aee260 daily-morning-briefing] It's 7 AM. Provide a morning briefing for Sam: 1. Current weather in Seoul (using weather skill). 2. Brief system status overview. 3. Any urgent notifications or tasks from memory. Keep it sharp and helpful.\nCurrent time: Saturday, April 4th, 2026 — 7:00 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-04-03 22:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775253603802}}
{"type":"message","id":"689faa8d","parentId":"cc3b6846","timestamp":"2026-04-03T22:00:08.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to provide a morning briefing for Sam. This is a cron job running at 7 AM. Let me check what I need to do:\n\n1. Get current weather in Seoul using the weather skill\n2. Brief system status overview\n3. Check for urgent notifications or tasks from memory\n\nLet me start by reading the weather skill to understand how to use it, then gather the information needed.\n\nAccording to the skills list, there's a weather skill at:\n`/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/weather/SKILL.md`\n\nLet me read that first to understand how to use it properly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7b4e156751c141c7af386a90","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":17302,"output":323,"cacheRead":2098,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19723,"cost":{"input":0.0103812,"output":0.0007106,"cacheRead":0.00023078,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01132258}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775253603805,"responseId":"202604040600062facc86312ed4bb3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6cbf4e5b","parentId":"689faa8d","timestamp":"2026-04-03T22:00:08.352Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7b4e156751c141c7af386a90","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: \"Get current weather and forecasts via wttr.in or Open-Meteo. Use when: user asks about weather, temperature, or forecasts for any location. NOT for: historical weather data, severe weather alerts, or detailed meteorological analysis. No API key needed.\"\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"emoji\": \"☔\",\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"curl\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"brew\",\n              \"kind\": \"brew\",\n              \"formula\": \"curl\",\n              \"bins\": [\"curl\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install curl (brew)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# Weather Skill\n\nGet current weather conditions and forecasts.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **USE this skill when:**\n\n- \"What's the weather?\"\n- \"Will it rain today/tomorrow?\"\n- \"Temperature in [city]\"\n- \"Weather forecast for the week\"\n- Travel planning weather checks\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n❌ **DON'T use this skill when:**\n\n- Historical weather data → use weather archives/APIs\n- Climate analysis or trends → use specialized data sources\n- Hyper-local microclimate data → use local sensors\n- Severe weather alerts → check official NWS sources\n- Aviation/marine weather → use specialized services (METAR, etc.)\n\n## Location\n\nAlways include a city, region, or airport code in weather queries.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Current Weather\n\n```bash\n# One-line summary\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n\n# Detailed current conditions\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?0\"\n\n# Specific city\ncurl \"wttr.in/New+York?format=3\"\n```\n\n### Forecasts\n\n```bash\n# 3-day forecast\ncurl \"wttr.in/London\"\n\n# Week forecast\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=v2\"\n\n# Specific day (0=today, 1=tomorrow, 2=day after)\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?1\"\n```\n\n### Format Options\n\n```bash\n# One-liner\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%w\"\n\n# JSON output\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=j1\"\n\n# PNG image\ncurl \"wttr.in/London.png\"\n```\n\n### Format Codes\n\n- `%c` — Weather condition emoji\n- `%t` — Temperature\n- `%f` — \"Feels like\"\n- `%w` — Wind\n- `%h` — Humidity\n- `%p` — Precipitation\n- `%l` — Location\n\n## Quick Responses\n\n**\"What's the weather?\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+(feels+like+%f),+%w+wind,+%h+humidity\"\n```\n\n**\"Will it rain?\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%p\"\n```\n\n**\"Weekend forecast\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=v2\"\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- No API key needed (uses wttr.in)\n- Rate limited; don't spam requests\n- Works for most global cities\n- Supports airport codes: `curl wttr.in/ORD`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775253608351}}
{"type":"message","id":"e76cc0e8","parentId":"6cbf4e5b","timestamp":"2026-04-03T22:00:27.379Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now I understand how to use the weather skill. Let me get the current weather in Seoul using wttr.in. I'll use a one-line summary format for brevity.\n\nNext, I need to check memory for any urgent notifications or tasks. Let me check:\n1. Today's memory file: memory/2026-04-04.md\n2. Yesterday's memory file: memory/2026-04-03.md (if today doesn't have much)\n3. MEMORY.md for any urgent long-term items\n\nLet me start with getting the weather and checking memory.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6953579123a34e31af2c17d2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"wttr.in/Seoul?format=%l:+%c+%t+(feels+like+%f),+%w+wind,+%h+humidity,+%p+precip\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4739478922364a4886221398","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-04.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":724,"output":317,"cacheRead":19579,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20620,"cost":{"input":0.0004344,"output":0.0006974,"cacheRead":0.00215369,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0032854900000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775253608353,"responseId":"20260404060011229551fc1c2546e6"}}
